Exception: fpga/src/board/rev1/dvi_tx/ holds the DVI_TX IP of Gowin
Semiconductor (encrypted netlist dvi_tx.v, configuration dvi_tx.ipc and the
post-PnR simulation model dvi_tx.vo), generated with the Gowin IDE and carried
as distributed by tnCart / tnCartWonder. It is vendor IP, not covered by the
BSD 3-Clause License above. See UPSTREAM.md.

Exception: the files in fpga/reports/ and its subfolders that are generated
by the Gowin tools are not covered by the BSD 3-Clause License above: the
resource reports *.rpt.txt and the timing reports *.tr, which keep the Gowin
Semiconductor header and template text and are included unmodified; the SDF
extracts *.sdf, which keep that header and copy unmodified cells and lines of
the SDF written by Gowin, plus a comment; and the gw_sh logs *.log, which
carry no header and are included unmodified. The other files in
fpga/reports/ (check_build.txt, *.fs.txt, LEEME.txt, *.sdc) are covered by it.
